%C A273354 A011541(k) is not the sum of two nonzero squares for 2 <= k <= 6.
%C A273354 From _Siddhartha Mahajan_, Aug 30 2026: (Start)
%C A273354 a(3) = A155960(1). An exhaustive check of the 110969 smaller candidates obtained from A003825 found no earlier value.
%C A273354 a(4) <= 14759227581930896847359976 = 5473083^3 + 245293629^3 = 44779770^3 + 244796076^3 = 124589232^3 + 234075402^3 = 172153338^3 + 212952684^3 = 51219100926^2 + 3841432569450^2 = 238433745690^2 + 3834367865874^2 = 2612174147226^2 + 2817050550930^2 = 2686353534774^2 + 2746403515170^2. (End)
%e A273354 a(1) = 2 because 2 = 1^3 + 1^3 = 1^2 + 1^2.
%e A273354 a(2) = 4624776 because 4624776 = 51^3 + 165^3 = 72^3 + 162^3 = 1026^2 + 1890^2 = 1350^2 + 1674^2.
%e A273354 a(3) = 11177126654841000000 because 11177126654841000000 = 279300^3 + 2234400^3 = 790020^3 + 2202480^3 = 1256850^3 + 2094750^3 = 936101880^2 + 3209492160^2 = 1176813792^2 + 3129254856^2 = 2005932600^2 + 2674576800^2. - _Siddhartha Mahajan_, Aug 30 2026
